# Optional launcher/development environment variables.
# PCS does not automatically load this file: set variables in your shell.
# No environment variable is required to run the editor.
# PCS_INSTALL_ROOT=./local-install
# PCS_UPDATE_ROOT=./local-update-feed
# PCS_SAFE_MODE=1
# GitHub credentials belong in Studio's optional connection UI / OS keyring.
# Never place tokens in VITE_* variables or commit credentials.
